ERDICT> **Confidence:** <HIGH|MEDIUM|LOW|UNVERIFIED> **Scope:** 87 paths; 14,460 insertions; 3,219 deletions. **Results:** <N> verified improvements, <N> verified regressions, <N> plausible regressions, <N> unproven claims. ### Verified improvements <INSERT ONLY ENTRIES FROM .notes/oracle/branch-trust-audit/lanes/01-shared-ui/02-observed-improvements.md> ### Regressions and unresolved trust gaps <INSERT ONLY ENTRIES FROM .notes/oracle/branch-trust-audit/lanes/01-shared-ui/03-breakage-candidates.md AND 04-proof-gaps.md> ### Screenshot <INSERT MANAGER-APPROVED UIA-S-## IMAGE> *Shared UI audit across Main, Actions, and a compact popup. The image shows visual parity only; keyboard, focus, lifecycle, and temporal claims are backed by separate runtime receipts.* ### Evidence - Path accounting: `.notes/oracle/branch-trust-audit/lanes/01-shared-ui/00-inventory.md` - Complete path ledger: `.notes/oracle/branch-trust-audit/lanes/01-shared-ui/01-path-ledger.tsv` - Findings: `.notes/oracle/branch-trust-audit/lanes/01-shared-ui/02-observed-improvements.md` and `.notes/oracle/branch-trust-audit/lanes/01-shared-ui/03-breakage-candidates.md` - Proof gaps: `.notes/oracle/branch-trust-audit/lanes/01-shared-ui/04-proof-gaps.md` - Terminal and runtime results: `.notes/oracle/branch-trust-audit/lanes/01-shared-ui/05-verification.md` - Screenshot requests: `.notes/oracle/branch-trust-audit/lanes/01-shared-ui/06-screenshot-requests.md` - Executable next actions: `.notes/oracle/branch-trust-audit/lanes/01-shared-ui/08-next-actions.md` <!-- END 01-shared-ui --> Before handoff: Bash! rg -n '<[A-Z][A-Z0-9_| -]*>' "$LANE/07-article-hunks.md" No unresolved placeholder may reach the manager. Integrated-ledger hunk JSON{ "lane": "01-shared-ui", "title": "Shared UI and design-system audit", "scopePaths": 87, "insertions": 14460, "deletions": 3219, "candidateHead": "<START_HEAD>", "candidateMain": "<START_MAIN>", "mergeBase": "<START_MERGE_BASE>", "verdict": "<verified|mixed|regressed|unverified>",